(Abstract) Tj
T*
(a multicentre investigation examined brief sleep restriction therapy for adults with) Tj
T*
(insomnia in older adults. Participants will be recruited within a pragmatic network of) Tj
T*
(hospital and community providers; the planned sample is 433 and sleep efficiency is the) Tj
T*
(principal endpoint. The protocol prespecifies safety, adherence, and quality-of-life) Tj
T*
(measures and describes procedures for missing observations. Interpretation is limited by) Tj
T*
(attrition and the pragmatic delivery setting. The analysis was designed to reflect the) Tj
T*
(decisions faced by clinicians in routine practice. This report is from a parallel-group) Tj
T*
(randomized controlled trial comparing Control: placebo education vs Intervention: CBT +) Tj
T*
(strength and balance exercise.) Tj
